  <item>
    <title>ep4.为什么“适工”的年轻人都在求神拜佛？｜如何当个快乐的螺丝钉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e9c3482d96b6aa80655f8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e9c3482d96b6aa80655f8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Mar 2024 13:38:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期玻璃房内邀请到了一位特别的嘉宾</span><em><strong><span>@阿随仔</span></strong></em><span>。我们相识在2019年北京，在一家娱乐宣传公司。此后，我们一直保持着联系，并在海南万宁重新见面，当时数字游民这个理念还并不那么广为人知。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期播客里，随仔给我们分享了她的不同时期的职场经历。我们聊了如何在职场里当一个快乐的螺丝钉，如何平衡工作和生活，如何给心理减负，如何在职场中社交，以及随仔给我们分享了两个鲜活的生活中的例子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客很长，更像是和生活中的朋友在聊天的感觉，希望听完这期播客，大家能够有所收获。期待在评论区看到你们的想法和观点.</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你喜欢这期的播客,记得一键三连哦~</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oz421D7EM/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oz421D7EM/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>在b站上关注且观看‘玻璃房内’</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 开头介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 随仔的职场经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 什么是老板思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 什么是学生思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 目标导向的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 如何当个快乐的螺丝钉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 工作生活的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 雍和宫的年轻人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 新加坡约会对象的不解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a> 国内外职场的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 职场上的人际交往</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 建立自己的边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 做自己的老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a> 薪资的不平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3563">59:23</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的社媒👇</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/iam_m1ni/" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/iam_m1ni/"><span>Instagram</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@minniechen" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@minniechen"><span>YouTube</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c0255276b58b74209129d52?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c0255276b58b74209129d52&amp;apptime=1696403656" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c0255276b58b74209129d52?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c0255276b58b74209129d52&amp;apptime=1696403656"><span>小红书</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/minniechen" data-url="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/minniechen"><span>Spotify</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>随仔的社媒👇</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55ad009941a2b3299a2a989a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6211086f0000000021024f0e&amp;apptime=1709850573" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55ad009941a2b3299a2a989a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6211086f0000000021024f0e&amp;apptime=1709850573"><span>小红书</span></a></p>]]></description>
