    <guid isPermaLink="false">657b836d3d5d24e9cb2be323</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Dec 2023 22:36:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我和一位来自日本的27岁女孩Mayu,在英国南边小镇上的一个农场当志愿者而结识.</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期播客里,日本女孩Mayu和我们分享了她在日本生活的经历,决定裸辞的原因,以及她的全球旅居的美妙故事.</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们还讨论了在英国农场当志愿者的感受,分享了农场的drama日常,还有对同期法国志愿者的一些看法.</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你喜欢这期的播客,记得一键三连哦~</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bw411x7wo/?vd_source=9737147d4b7232974cb0f752007b658b#reply324803960" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bw411x7wo/?vd_source=9737147d4b7232974cb0f752007b658b#reply324803960"><span>在b站上关注且观看‘玻璃房内’</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我的社媒</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/mmminniechen/" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/mmminniechen/"><span>Instagram</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@minniechen" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@minniechen"><span>YouTube</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c0255276b58b74209129d52?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c0255276b58b74209129d52&amp;apptime=1696403656" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c0255276b58b74209129d52?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c0255276b58b74209129d52&amp;apptime=1696403656"><span>小红书</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/minniechen" data-url="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/minniechen"><span>Spotify</span></a></p>]]></description>
